			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Breaking the Biosecurity Bottleneck: A Smarter Way to Keep Your Practice Compliant, Efficient, and Safe</title>
		<link>https://www.scisan.co.za/breaking-the-biosecurity-bottleneck-a-smarter-way-to-keep-your-practice-compliant-efficient-and-safe/</link>
					<comments>https://www.scisan.co.za/breaking-the-biosecurity-bottleneck-a-smarter-way-to-keep-your-practice-compliant-efficient-and-safe/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 09:17:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[SANI-99™ for Vets]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.scisan.co.uk/?p=8289</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Veterinary practices face a growing “biosecurity bottleneck” — balancing fast workflows with strict hygiene standards. Discover how SANI-99™ for Vets delivers 10-second, DEFRA-approved disinfection that’s safe, compliant, and sustainable.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In veterinary medicine, time is never on your side. Between back-to-back consults, surgery turnovers, and managing contagious cases, maintaining effective disinfection often becomes a rushed routine — not a rigorous process.<br>Yet even small lapses in protocol or ineffective products can lead to costly outbreaks, failed inspections, or reputational damage.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The Challenge: The Compliance–Efficiency Gap</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Many veterinary practices struggle to balance <strong>rapid turnover</strong> with <strong>regulatory-grade biosecurity</strong>.<br>Common obstacles include:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Long contact times</strong> or complex dilution ratios that disrupt workflow.</li>



<li><strong>Incomplete pathogen coverage</strong>, especially against resistant viruses like Parvovirus and Adenovirus.</li>



<li><strong>Non-compliance with DEFRA and EN veterinary standards</strong>, leaving gaps during audits.</li>



<li><strong>Harsh or scented chemicals</strong> that cause respiratory irritation, surface corrosion, or animal stress.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This creates what many call the <strong>“biosecurity bottleneck”</strong> — when infection-control processes slow operations or fail to meet modern compliance expectations.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The Hidden Cost of Getting It Wrong</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A sub-par disinfectant or a missed contact time doesn’t just risk infection — it can result in:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Quarantine orders or temporary shutdowns.</li>



<li>Failed Fear Free audits due to harsh or perfumed products.</li>



<li>Reputational loss with clients who expect visible hygiene excellence.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These are operational and emotional costs most veterinary professionals can’t afford.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Introducing a New Standard: SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> for Vets</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> for Vets</strong> eliminates the biosecurity bottleneck — combining <strong>speed, spectrum, and safety</strong> in one certified system.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Key advantages include:</strong><br></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>10-second kill time</strong> validated under EN 1276 and EN 1040 protocols.</li>



<li><strong>DEFRA-approved</strong> for Foot &amp; Mouth, Avian Influenza, and Newcastle Disease.</li>



<li><strong>LOG 7 (99.99995%)</strong> pathogen reduction — far beyond standard disinfectants.</li>



<li><strong>Fear Free-compliant</strong>, fragrance-free, residue-free, and non-corrosive.</li>



<li><strong>Sustainable powder sachets</strong> (6 g/L dilution) — easy to mix, minimal waste, and stable for 180 days once diluted.</li>



<li>Certified under <strong>EN 1656</strong>, <strong>EN 14349</strong>, and <strong>EU BPR PT 3 &amp; PT 4</strong>, making it ideal for both <strong>clinical</strong> and <strong>food/feed-contact</strong> environments.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> replaces complexity with confidence — delivering hospital-grade efficacy without slowing your team down or compromising patient well-being.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Efficiency Meets Assurance</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" />, you can disinfect faster, stay compliant with DEFRA and EN veterinary standards, and protect both your team and your patients — all while reducing waste and chemical exposure.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Veterinary professionals deserve infection control that’s as advanced and compassionate as the care they provide.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ready to Eliminate the Biosecurity Bottleneck?</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Your next inspection shouldn’t be stressful — it should be seamless.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Order or request a sample today:</strong><br><a href="https://www.samaxia.com/item/SANI-99trade-for-Vets-Disinfectant"><strong>SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> for Vets Disinfectant – via Samaxia </strong></a></p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.scisan.co.za/breaking-the-biosecurity-bottleneck-a-smarter-way-to-keep-your-practice-compliant-efficient-and-safe/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
