			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Delivering Clean Water to Samburu: A Milestone in Our Humanitarian Mission</title>
		<link>https://www.scisan.co.za/delivering-clean-water-to-samburu-a-milestone-in-our-humanitarian-mission/</link>
					<comments>https://www.scisan.co.za/delivering-clean-water-to-samburu-a-milestone-in-our-humanitarian-mission/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 23 Jun 2025 10:25:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[SANI AMANZI]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[African communities]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[children’s health]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[chlorine-free]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Clean Water]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[clean water access]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[community health]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[eco-friendly solutions]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[global health]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[humanitarian aid]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Kenya]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NGO support]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[nonprofit]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[point-of-use water treatment]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[rural development]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[safe drinking water]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[safe water solutions]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Samburu]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Sanitation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[scientific sanitation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[sustainability]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[sustainable development]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Water crisis]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water for schools]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water impact]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water innovation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water purification]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water security]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[water technology]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[waterborne disease]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.scisan.co.uk/?p=8040</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[In the heart of Samburu, Kenya — where clean drinking water is scarce and waterborne illness is a daily threat — Scientific Sanitation Solutions is proud to support a breakthrough. With our portable, chlorine-free purifier SANI AMANZI™, and the efforts of Samantha Shelton on the ground, we’ve helped bring safe, drinkable water to a rural school of 45 children. This is just one village — hundreds more need our help.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At Scientific Sanitation Solutions (SSS), our mission has always been rooted in delivering innovative, sustainable, and accessible hygiene and water solutions to communities in greatest need. Over the past six months, that mission came to life in Samburu, Kenya — a region that ranks among the lowest in the country for access to clean drinking water.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With our partner on the ground, <strong>Samantha Shelton</strong>, and the invaluable assistance of the <strong>Kenyan military</strong>, we’ve proudly supported the rollout of our flagship water purification solution, <strong>SANI AMANZI<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong>, to one of the many remote villages in Samburu. This project is more than a deployment — it is a step toward transformation.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><a href="https://vimeo.com/1092387205/35e50921b3?share=copy">Watch the journey</a></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Why Samburu?</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Children in Samburu face a daily risk that is hard to comprehend: drinking water from untreated sources that are visibly unsafe — often brown, stagnant, and filled with disease-causing pathogens. In one school alone, over <strong>45 children were suffering from chronic diarrhoea, dehydration, and stomach infections</strong>. There were no nearby clinics. No water infrastructure. No safe alternatives.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The SANI AMANZI<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Impact</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>SANI AMANZI<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong> is not just a product — it’s a <strong>lifesaving innovation</strong>. Each 6g sachet purifies up to 20 litres of contaminated water in under 30 minutes, requiring no electricity, no complex tools, and no technical training. It removes 99.99% of bacteria, viruses, and protozoa — including <strong>E. coli, Salmonella, Shigella</strong>, and <strong>antibiotic-resistant strains</strong>. Crucially, it is <strong>chlorine-free</strong>, leaving behind fresh-tasting water that communities trust and enjoy.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Chlorine-free</strong></li>



<li><strong>0 E. coli per 100ml after treatment</strong></li>



<li><strong>Effective against antibiotic-resistant bacteria</strong></li>



<li><strong>Eco-friendly, low-carbon packaging</strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As seen in the <a href="https://vimeo.com/1092387205/35e50921b3?share=copy">video</a>, the moment the children tasted safe, clean water for the first time was unforgettable. Their reactions — clapping, cheering, smiling — captured the hope that clean water brings.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>One Village Down — Hundreds More to Go</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This success is just the beginning. Samburu is one of <strong>many underserved regions across Kenya and Africa</strong> where access to clean water remains a daily struggle. We are committed to expanding the reach of SANI AMANZI<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> across schools, villages, and entire regions — with your help.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you are a humanitarian, NGO, government entity, or private sponsor looking to support clean water access, we invite you to partner with us.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Join Us in Expanding the Reach of Clean Water</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Learn more about SANI AMANZI<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> and our testing standards<br>Partner with us: <a href="http://www.scisan.co.uk">www.scisan.co.uk</a><br>Watch the video: <a href="https://vimeo.com/1092387205/35e50921b3?share=copy">Samburu Clean Water Project</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Scientific Sanitation Solutions</strong> is proud to have been founded with a humanitarian purpose. We stand behind the science, the product, and the people making change possible on the ground.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Let’s bring <strong>clean water, dignity, and health</strong> to every corner of Kenya — and beyond.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">#SANIAMANZI #CaringforLife #CleanWater #Samburu #Kenya #SafeWater #HumanitarianInnovation</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.scisan.co.za/delivering-clean-water-to-samburu-a-milestone-in-our-humanitarian-mission/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>The Future of NHS Disinfection: Why Trusts Are Switching to SANI‑99™</title>
		<link>https://www.scisan.co.za/the-future-of-nhs-disinfection-why-trusts-are-switching-to-sani%e2%80%9199/</link>
					<comments>https://www.scisan.co.za/the-future-of-nhs-disinfection-why-trusts-are-switching-to-sani%e2%80%9199/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Jun 2025 11:41:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[SANI-99™]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AlcoholFree]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Antimicrobial]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[CdiffControl]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ChlorineFree]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[CleanWithConfidence]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[DisinfectionInnovation]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[EcoDisinfectant]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[EN14476]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[EN17126]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[FragranceFree]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[GreenNHS]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[HealthcareHygiene]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[HealthcareSafety]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[HospitalHygiene]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[InfectionControl]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[InfectionPrevention]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Log7]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[MedicalCleaning]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NetZero]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NHSApproved]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NHSCompliance]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NHSDisinfection]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NHSProcurement]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NHSSupplyChain]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NonCorrosive]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[NorovirusPrevention]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[SaferCleaning]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[SANI99]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[SmartHygiene]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[SustainableCleaning]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.scisan.co.uk/?p=8033</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Infection control in NHS settings is evolving—fast. Traditional chlorine and alcohol-based disinfectants are falling short on safety, sustainability, and efficacy. SANI‑99™ is a Log 7, alcohol- and chlorine-free solution now available via NHS Supply Chain, delivering clinically proven performance against C. difficile, Norovirus, MRSA and more—while slashing carbon impact and simplifying compliance. Discover why NHS Trusts are making the switch.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In an era where healthcare demands safer, greener, and more effective infection control, the NHS is rethinking its reliance on traditional disinfectants. Products like chlorine, bleach, and alcohol-based solutions—once seen as the gold standard—now present serious limitations: corrosiveness, health hazards, poor environmental performance, and inconsistent pathogen control.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">That’s why NHS Trusts are turning to <strong>SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong>: a <strong>next-generation, alcohol-free, chlorine-free disinfectant</strong> that offers <strong>Log</strong><strong> </strong><strong>7 kill-rate performance</strong>, unmatched environmental credentials, and ease of use across all healthcare environments.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Now <strong>fully available via NHS Supply Chain</strong>, SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> marks a significant advancement in infection prevention for the NHS.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Now Available to Order on NHS Supply Chain</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The complete <strong>SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Disinfectant Range</strong> is live and ready to order:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85484">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Starter Pack – Bottle for Life + sachets</a></strong></li>



<li><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85488">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> 25 Sachet Pack – reduced waste, big value</a></strong></li>



<li><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85487">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Drain Cleaner Sachet – powerful drain hygiene</a></strong></li>



<li><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85483">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Pre-filled Solutions – grab-and-go convenience</a></strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">All products are supported with full EN certifications, MSDS documentation, and verified carbon reporting to meet NHS Green Plan and PPN 06/21 compliance standards.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>A Scientific Breakthrough in Infection Control</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> is clinically formulated to deliver a <strong>99.99995% kill rate (Log</strong><strong> </strong><strong>7)</strong>—outperforming standard disinfectants that typically offer Log 3 or Log 4 efficacy. It is independently tested and certified to:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>EN 17126</strong> (C. difficile spores)</li>



<li><strong>EN 14476</strong> (viruses including Norovirus and SARS‑CoV‑2)</li>



<li><strong>EN 13727 &amp; EN 1276</strong> (bacteria including MRSA, E. coli, Pseudomonas)</li>



<li><strong>EN 1500</strong> (hand hygiene)</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This powerful, broad-spectrum activity means fewer organisms remain after cleaning—just <strong>50 per square metre</strong>, compared to 10,000+ with traditional 99.9% effective solutions.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Why NHS Trusts Are Moving Away from Chlorine and Alcohol</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Despite their widespread use, chlorine-based disinfectants and alcohol rubs bring serious drawbacks:</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Challenge</strong></td><td><strong>Traditional Disinfectants</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Corrosive</strong> to surfaces and medical equipment</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Short <strong>shelf life</strong> after dilution (24h)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Strong odour</strong>, irritant to staff and patients</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Require <strong>PPE</strong> and hazardous waste handling</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Contribute <strong>high CO₂ emissions</strong> and toxic residues</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Flammable (alcohol-based rubs)</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These legacy products often fail to meet the NHS’s modern requirements for <strong>safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Why SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> Is the Future of NHS Disinfection</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Clinical-Grade Efficacy</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Log 7 performance</strong> kills pathogens more effectively and faster than most alternatives.</li>



<li>Eliminates bacteria, viruses, spores, mould, and fungi—ideal for outbreak control and routine hygiene.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Alcohol-, Chlorine- &amp; Fragrance-Free</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Safe for frequent use across wards, ICUs, care homes, and GP practices.</li>



<li>No VOCs, no respiratory irritation, no corrosion—<strong>better for staff and patient wellbeing</strong>.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>No PPE Required</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Non-toxic, non-corrosive, and <strong>safe to use without gloves or masks</strong>.</li>



<li>Suitable for spray, mop, fogging, and electrostatic applications.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Hand Hygiene Certified</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>EN 1500 certified for hygienic hand rub use—<strong>a rare distinction among disinfectants</strong>.</li>



<li>Simplifies product stock by covering both surfaces and skin safely.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Extended Shelf Life</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>180-day stability once diluted</strong> — compared to 1-day shelf life for hypochlorite.</li>



<li>Reduces waste and stock spoilage.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> vs Traditional Disinfectants: The Evidence-Based Choice</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Category</strong></td><td><strong>Traditional Disinfectants</strong></td><td><strong>SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Kill Rate</strong></td><td>Log 3–4 (99.9–99.99%)</td><td><strong>Log</strong><strong> </strong><strong>7 (99.99995%)</strong> – validated for NHS pathogens</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Effective Against Spores</strong></td><td>Often ineffective against C. difficile</td><td><strong>Yes</strong> – EN 17126 certified</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Effective Against Norovirus</strong></td><td>Limited – not EN 14476 certified</td><td><strong>Yes</strong> – EN 14476 certified</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shelf Life (Mixed)</strong></td><td>~24 hours</td><td><strong>Up to 180 days</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>PPE Required</strong></td><td>Yes – irritant/corrosive</td><td><strong>No – non-toxic, non-irritant</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Surface Corrosiveness</strong></td><td>Yes – damages beds, metal &amp; plastics</td><td><strong>None – safe on all surfaces</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Odour and VOCs</strong></td><td>Strong bleach or chemical odour</td><td><strong>Fragrance-free, no VOCs</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Application Versatility</strong></td><td>Surface only; often incompatible with foggers</td><td><strong>Surface, drains, fogging, and hand use</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Environmental Impact (CO₂e)</strong></td><td>Up to 2,000g per litre</td><td><strong>Just 3g per litre</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Biodegradable</strong></td><td>No – residual chlorine harmful to water systems</td><td><strong>Yes – 100% biodegradable</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Disposal Requirements</strong></td><td>Hazardous waste streams</td><td><strong>General waste – no COSHH hazard</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This side-by-side analysis reinforces why SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> is the <strong>smarter, safer, and more sustainable</strong> choice for modern NHS estates.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>&nbsp;Use Cases Across NHS Settings</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Outbreak control</strong>: Proven against <strong>C. difficile</strong> (EN 17126) and <strong>Norovirus</strong> (EN 14476)</li>



<li><strong>Routine ward hygiene</strong>: Ideal for <strong>daily cleaning of high-touch areas and shared equipment</strong></li>



<li><strong>Drain sanitation</strong>: Targets biofilms and odours in clinical drainage infrastructure</li>



<li><strong>Fogging and misting</strong>: Supports full-room disinfection with <strong>no hazmat precautions needed</strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>How to Order</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">All four SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> products are now available through NHS Supply Chain:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85484">Starter Pack</a></strong> | &nbsp;<strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85488">25 Sachet Pack</a></strong><br><strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85487">Drain Cleaner Sachet</a></strong> | <strong><a href="https://my.supplychain.nhs.uk/catalogue/product/mkj85483">Pre-filled Solution</a></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Full technical documents, MSDS, EN certificates, and carbon impact reports are available on request.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Ready to Step Into the Future of Infection Control?</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> offers NHS Trusts a reliable, future-proof disinfectant that:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Improves patient and staff safety</li>



<li>Reduces long-term operational costs</li>



<li>Aligns with NHS Net Zero targets</li>



<li>Simplifies compliance across all settings</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Cleaner. Safer. Smarter. SANI‑99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> is the next generation of NHS disinfection.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Learn More or Request a Procurement Pack:</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="mailto:info@scisan.co.uk">info@scisan.co.uk</a><br><a href="http://www.scisan.co.uk">www.scisan.co.uk</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">#SANI99 #NHSSupplyChain #NHSDisinfection #GreenNHS #NetZero #InfectionControl #CdiffControl #NorovirusPrevention #HealthcareHygiene #CleanWithConfidence</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
