		<item>
		<title>SANI-99™: A Scientific Breakthrough in Mould and Pest Control</title>
		<link>https://www.scisan.co.za/sani-99-a-scientific-breakthrough-in-mould-and-pest-control/</link>
					<comments>https://www.scisan.co.za/sani-99-a-scientific-breakthrough-in-mould-and-pest-control/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 05 Jun 2025 10:08:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[SANI-99™]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.scisan.co.uk/?p=8028</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[SANI-99™ revolutionises pest control by targeting mould—the root cause of many infestations. This eco-friendly, medical-grade disinfectant offers a powerful, sustainable alternative to pesticides in all environments.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the ongoing quest for healthier, safer indoor environments, <strong>SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /></strong> has emerged as a transformative solution. This advanced biocidal disinfectant not only eradicates mould with near-total efficacy but also disrupts pest ecosystems by eliminating their critical food sources and habitats. With wide-ranging applications across residential, healthcare, industrial, and food-handling settings, SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> redefines what it means to clean and protect.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The Hidden Link: Mould and Pests</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Damp environments create a perfect breeding ground for both mould and pests. Mould provides organic material that supports pests such as:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Silverfish</strong></li>



<li><strong>Mould mites</strong></li>



<li><strong>Booklice</strong></li>



<li><strong>Carpet beetles</strong></li>



<li><strong>Fungus gnats</strong></li>



<li><strong>Scuttle flies</strong></li>



<li><strong>Cockroaches</strong></li>



<li><strong>Foreign grain beetles</strong></li>



<li><strong>Termites</strong></li>



<li><strong>Slugs</strong></li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These organisms often thrive in symbiosis with mould, feeding on it directly or inhabiting materials it degrades. Therefore, a strategy that targets mould at its root also offers an indirect but highly effective form of pest control.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" />: The Science of Total Mould Eradication</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> employs a proprietary blend of oxidising agents including <strong>potassium peroxymonosulfate</strong> and <strong>peracetic acid</strong>, delivering a remarkable <strong>99.99995%</strong> reduction in mould and pathogens. Laboratory testing under EN 13697 and EN 1276 confirms its effectiveness against a wide array of bacteria, fungi, and viruses—including E. coli, Salmonella, Listeria, and SARS-CoV-2.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Key Scientific Features:</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Broad-spectrum action</strong>: Proven virucidal, bactericidal, fungicidal, and sporicidal performance.</li>



<li><strong>Long residual efficacy</strong>: Continues to inhibit regrowth of mould and microbial life for extended periods.</li>



<li><strong>Non-toxic and biodegradable</strong>: Chlorine- and alcohol-free, making it safe for indoor and sensitive environments.</li>



<li><strong>Surface-safe and non-corrosive</strong>: Suitable for use on walls, tiles, fabrics, and even medical-grade surfaces.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Pest Control via Ecological Disruption</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Unlike traditional pesticides that kill pests directly (often introducing toxicity concerns), SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> adopts a preventive strategy: by <strong>eliminating mould</strong>, it removes the food and shelter sources pests rely on to survive and reproduce.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Impact on Pest Populations:</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Nutritional disruption</strong>: Without mould, pests lose access to essential sustenance.</li>



<li><strong>Environmental alteration</strong>: Dry, mould-free areas are inhospitable to moisture-loving pests like silverfish and mites.</li>



<li><strong>Material preservation</strong>: By halting mould-induced degradation, SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> prevents the exposure of starchy substrates that attract pests.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Laboratory Validated Performance</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Extensive lab testing under European and global standards confirms SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" />’s high efficacy across all categories:</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Test Standard</strong></td><td><strong>Pathogen</strong></td><td><strong>Reduction</strong></td><td><strong>Efficacy</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>EN 1276</strong></td><td><em>E. coli</em>, <em>S. aureus</em></td><td>&gt;7 Log</td><td>99.99999%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>EN 13697</strong></td><td><em>Candida albicans</em>, <em>Aspergillus brasiliensis</em></td><td>&gt;7 Log</td><td>99.999997%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>EN 14476</strong></td><td><em>SARS-CoV-2</em>, <em>Norovirus</em>, <em>Adenovirus</em></td><td>&gt;4 Log</td><td>99.995%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>EN 17126</strong></td><td><em>Clostridium difficile</em></td><td>&gt;4 Log</td><td>Sporicidal</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These metrics confirm SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> as not only effective but <strong>exceptional in real-world applications</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Sustainability and Safety</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> stands apart with its environmental stewardship and commitment to health:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Biodegradable formulation</strong>: Breaks down into oxygen and sulphate, posing no bioaccumulation risk.</li>



<li><strong>“One Bottle for Life” packaging</strong>: Reduces single-use plastic waste.</li>



<li><strong>No hazardous classification when diluted</strong>: In solution, SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> poses no environmental, flammability, or health risks, simplifying handling and application.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Use Cases</strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Residential</strong>: Kitchens, bathrooms, bedrooms, and HVAC systems.</li>



<li><strong>Commercial</strong>: Offices, hotels, gyms, and public transport.</li>



<li><strong>Healthcare</strong>: Wards, surgical theatres, patient rooms.</li>



<li><strong>Food Preparation</strong>: Surface sanitation, equipment, storage areas.</li>
</ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> does more than disinfect. It interrupts the life cycles of pests by addressing the root cause: mould. Its dual action of <strong>bio-elimination</strong> and <strong>ecological sanitation</strong> positions it as a <strong>cutting-edge, sustainable alternative to conventional pest control and biocidal products</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Whether you are a facilities manager, healthcare professional, or homeowner, adopting SANI-99<img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/2122.png" alt="™" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> means taking a science-backed step toward a <strong>cleaner, safer, and pest-free environment</strong>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
